---
// FeaturesModal.astro - Modal com Detalhes Semióticos e Práticos do Card do Paciente
---

<div class="features-modal-overlay" id="featuresModalOverlay" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="features-modal-content">
    <div class="modal-top">
      <div>
        <span class="modal-eyebrow">SEMIÓTICA & PRATICIDADE</span>
        <h3 class="t-title modal-heading">Inteligência visual na ponta dos dedos</h3>
        <p class="t-small modal-subheading">Informações clínicas e financeiras essenciais resolvidas em segundos, direto no card do paciente.</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn" id="btnCloseFeaturesModal" aria-label="Fechar">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-grid">
      <!-- 1: Relógio do Agendamento & 4 Cores -->
      <div class="modal-feature-box">
        <div class="feature-box-header">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Relógio do Agendamento (4 Cores)</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          Muda de cor conforme o momento da consulta. Bateu o olho, sabe na hora o status da recepção sem ler listas ou perguntar para secretárias.
        </p>
        <div class="clock-mini-legend" aria-label="Significado das 4 cores do relógio">
          <span class="clock-chip chip-green"><span class="chip-dot dot-green"></span>Verde: Hoje</span>
          <span class="clock-chip chip-blue"><span class="chip-dot dot-blue"></span>Azul: Futuro</span>
          <span class="clock-chip chip-orange"><span class="chip-dot dot-orange"></span>Laranja: Chegou</span>
          <span class="clock-chip chip-red"><span class="chip-dot dot-red"></span>Vermelho: Atraso</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2: Símbolo Financeiro ($) -->
      <div class="modal-feature-box">
        <div class="feature-box-header">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
              <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Símbolo Financeiro ($)</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          Exibe a situação financeira consolidada do paciente. Um clique no '$' abre o extrato rápido com débitos, pagamentos e recibos.
        </p>
        <div class="clock-mini-legend" aria-label="Situações do Símbolo Financeiro">
          <span class="clock-chip chip-green"><span class="chip-dot dot-green"></span>Quitado</span>
          <span class="clock-chip chip-orange"><span class="chip-dot dot-orange"></span>Pendente</span>
          <span class="clock-chip chip-red"><span class="chip-dot dot-red"></span>Em Débito</span>
          <span class="clock-chip chip-blue"><span class="chip-dot dot-blue"></span>Com Crédito</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3: Pílula de Recorrência Semanal -->
      <div class="modal-feature-box">
        <div class="feature-box-header">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Recorrência Semanal (D, S, T, Q, Q, S, S)</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          Destaca os dias fixos da semana em que o paciente frequenta o tratamento (ex: Segundas, Quartas e Sextas), facilitando a gestão sem abrir o calendário.
        </p>
        <div class="recurrence-mini-preview" aria-label="Exemplo de dias fixos do paciente">
          <span class="day-dot">D</span>
          <span class="day-dot day-active">S</span>
          <span class="day-dot">T</span>
          <span class="day-dot day-active">Q</span>
          <span class="day-dot">Q</span>
          <span class="day-dot day-active">S</span>
          <span class="day-dot">S</span>
          <span class="recurrence-label">Seg, Qua e Sex</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4: Tags de Linhas de Cuidado -->
      <div class="modal-feature-box">
        <div class="feature-box-header">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"></path>
              <line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7.01" y2="7"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Tags de Linhas de Cuidado & Protocolos</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          Etiquetas coloridas personalizadas por queixa para bater o olho no card e saber exatamente qual protocolo o paciente está realizando.
        </p>
        <div class="tags-mini-preview" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="tag-pill tag-purple">Coluna Cervical</span>
          <span class="tag-pill tag-peach">Liberação Miofascial</span>
          <span class="tag-pill tag-blue">Reabilitação de Joelho</span>
          <span class="tag-pill tag-violet">Pilates Clínico</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5: Busca Instantânea & Atalhos Rápidos -->
      <div class="modal-feature-box">
        <div class="feature-box-header">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Busca Inteligente & Atalhos Rápidos</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          Localize qualquer paciente em milissegundos por nome, CPF ou telefone sem recarregar a tela, acelerando a rotina do consultório.
        </p>
        <div class="shortcuts-mini-preview" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="shortcut-chip"><kbd>⌘K</kbd> Buscar paciente</span>
          <span class="shortcut-chip"><kbd>N</kbd> Novo cadastro</span>
          <span class="shortcut-chip"><kbd>/</kbd> Busca rápida</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6: WhatsApp Integrado em 1 Toque -->
      <div class="modal-feature-box">
        <div class="feature-box-header">
          <div class="feature-icon-badge">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Contato no WhatsApp em 1 Toque</strong>
        </div>
        <p>
          Inicie conversas oficiais para confirmações e lembretes com um toque ao lado do paciente, sem precisar gravar o contato na sua agenda pessoal.
        </p>
        <div class="whatsapp-mini-preview" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="whatsapp-pill">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Conversar com o paciente</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-bottom">
      <a href="#planos" class="btn-clay t-small" id="modalCtaPlanos">
        Experimentar com 20 atendimentos grátis
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .features-modal-overlay {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background-color: rgba(20, 22, 25, 0.65);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2vmin, 2rem);
  }

  .features-modal-overlay.is-active {
    display: flex;
  }

  .features-modal-content {
    background: var(--card);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 860px;
    max-height: 88vh;
    border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vmin, 2.5rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .modal-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .modal-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--clay);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .modal-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vmin, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .modal-subheading {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .modal-close-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sand);
    color: var(--foreground);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .modal-close-btn:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bone);
  }

  .modal-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .modal-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .modal-feature-box {
    background: var(--background);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .modal-feature-box:hover {
    border-color: rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feature-box-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .feature-icon-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--clay);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .modal-feature-box p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .clock-mini-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .clock-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .chip-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .chip-green { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; }
  .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }

  .chip-blue { background: #dbeafe; color: #1d4ed8; }
  .dot-blue { background: #3b82f6; }

  .chip-orange { background: #ffedd5; color: #c2410c; }
  .dot-orange { background: #f97316; }

  .chip-red { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; }
  .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }

  .recurrence-mini-preview {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .day-dot {
    width: 1.4rem;
    height: 1.4rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--sand);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .day-dot.day-active {
    background: var(--clay);
    color: var(--bone);
  }

  .recurrence-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin-left: 0.35rem;
  }

  .tags-mini-preview {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .tag-pill {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .tag-purple { background: #f3e8ff; color: #7e22ce; }
  .tag-peach { background: #ffedd5; color: #c2410c; }
  .tag-blue { background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; }
  .tag-violet { background: #fae8ff; color: #86198f; }

  .shortcuts-mini-preview {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .shortcut-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .shortcut-chip kbd {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--sand);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .whatsapp-mini-preview {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .whatsapp-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #15803d;
    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .modal-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  #modalCtaPlanos {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
